OL,3,ASwinney insists 'stars are aligning'
OL,4,Afor Scottish independence
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will seek to press the case for
OL,7,Fanother independence referendum in the
OL,8,Fwake of elections in May which saw the
OL,9,FSNP win a record fifth term in
OL,10,Fgovernment at Holyrood.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
