OL,3,ABoy, 16, and 80-year-old man die in
OL,4,Alight aircraft crash near Loch Lomond
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy and 80-year-old man
OL,7,Fhave died following a light aircraft
OL,8,Fcrash near Loch Lomond.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fscene of the crash at about 16:45 on
OL,12,FFriday.
OL,14,FThe boy and man were pronounced dead
OL,15,Fand their next of kin have been made
OL,16,Faware, police said.
OL,18,FTemporary airspace restrictions are
OL,19,Fcurrently in place over the area while
OL,20,Fthe Air Accidents Investigation Branch
OL,21,Fconduct their inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
