OL,3,ADozens arrested in Paris as day of
OL,4,Aprotests begins across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gilets jaunes (yellow vests)
OL,7,Fdemonstrated against cost-of-living
OL,8,Fhikes for over a year from 2018 -
OL,9,Fbecoming one of the longest-lived
OL,10,Fprotest movements in French history
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
